        [fecfrm3.pdf p1](https://www.fec.gov/resources/cms-content/documents/policy-guidance/fecfrm3.pdf#page=1))."""
    @property
    def state_of_election(self) -> str | None:
        """Line 4, "in the State of": the state holding that election
